 'Food Preparation':[{q:'Where do you begin a donut order?',answers:['With flour, sugar, egg and milk, following the recipe.','With a finished donut from nowhere.','By skipping to the sprinkles.'],correct:0},{q:'The order says extra lettuce and no tomatoes. What do you make?',answers:['Triple tomatoes.','A sandwich that matches the requested amounts.','A plain bun.'],correct:1},{q:'An ingredient is out of stock. What is your next step?',answers:['Pretend it is available.','Send an incomplete order.','Tell the operations manager and order more supplies.'],correct:2}],
